              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akkasumas Waaqni nama kamiifuu badhaadhummaa fi qabeenya kennee akka inni itti gammadu, akka inni qooda ofii isaa fudhatee hojii ofii isaatti gammadu isa godhuun isaa, kennaa Waaqaa ti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
